{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2gg64w00","type":"work","title":"仙都志","authors":[{"name":"陳性定","role":"撰","name_basis":"原作「道士陳性定」，將身分標記「道士」混入姓名欄。道士為身分標記而非姓名之一部（本庫僧人亦以「釋某」立目而不冠「僧」「和尚」），逕正為「陳性定」。","dynasty":"元","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bjo5"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《仙都志》•二卷","author_info":"元道士陳性定撰","summary":"元道士陳性定撰。仙都山古名縉雲山，唐天寶中敕改今名。此志分六門，曰《山川》，曰《祠宇》，曰《神仙》，曰《高士》，曰《草木》，曰《碑碣題詠》。前序題至正戊子，不著姓名，以序及志中《祠宇門》考之，蓋元延祐中給道士趙嗣祺五品印，提點是山玉虛宮。羽流榮之，因撰是志也。","edition":"兩淮馬裕家藏本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《仙都志》二卷","author_info":"元陳性定撰","summary":"《仙都志》二卷。元陳性定撰。影印國家圖書館藏瞿氏鐵琴銅劍樓抄本。","edition":"影印國家圖書館藏瞿氏鐵琴銅劍樓抄本","volume":"第723冊","section":"史部 史部"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《仙都志》十五卷","author_info":"元陳性定撰","summary":"《仙都志》十五卷。元陳性定撰。涵芬樓影印明正統刻道藏本。","edition":"涵芬樓影印明正統刻道藏本","volume":"第228冊","section":"史部"},{"source":"元史藝文志","source_bid":"d59f2mp1zsoz","title_info":"陳性定仙都志二卷","summary":"元陳性定仙都志二卷"}],"juan_count":{"number":2},"resources":[{"id":"wikisource","name":"维基文库","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/仙都志","types":["text"]},{"id":"shidianguji-qushitieqintongjianl","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02086584","metadata":{"edition":"瞿氏鐵琴銅劍樓抄本","version":"v4","total_page":72,"paragraph_count":94,"has_translation":true,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-shanghaihanfenlouyin","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/DZ0602","metadata":{"edition":"上海涵芬樓影印明《正統道藏》本","version":"v3","total_page":82,"paragraph_count":336,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-chaoben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02052121","metadata":{"edition":"抄本","version":"v3","total_page":157,"paragraph_count":189,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02086584.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-